    "walkthrough": "Webhook Start 2 sends the survey through SMS 122, then Receive 11 waits 600 seconds for an SMS reply. Branch 22 accepts values 1 through 5 and sends the thank-you message. Any other answer goes through correction SMS 143 and back to Receive 11, creating the observed retry loop. There is no captured persistence/API node to store the rating and no explicit attempt counter in the loop.",
